      "special_list": {
        "0": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "details": "<p>When <strong>Lava Golem</strong> is hit by a melee attack, if that attack total accuracy check is <strong>lower than 10</strong>,<strong>&nbsp;</strong>the weapon used in the attack is temporary <strong>damaged</strong> and cannot be used again until the end of scene.</p>",
          "icon": "",
          "macro_name": "",
          "roll": "",
          "special_name": "Melting Body"
        },
        "1": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "details": "<p>At the start of its turn, if&nbsp;<strong>Lava Golem&nbsp;</strong>is&nbsp;<strong>Grappling&nbsp;</strong>a creature, that creature becomes <strong><img src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Buff%20Icon/Burn.png\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\">@UUID[JournalEntry.MSRXG4jUMPFpM9sN]{Burn}</strong>.</p>",
          "icon": "",
          "macro_name": "",
          "roll": "",
          "special_name": "Melting Embrace"
        },
        "2": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "details": "<p>When&nbsp;<strong>Lava Golem</strong> Hit Points drops to <strong>0</strong>, if it is&nbsp;<strong>Grappling&nbsp;</strong>a creature, that creature becomes&nbsp;<strong><img src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Buff%20Icon/DEF%20DOWN.png\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\">@UUID[JournalEntry.HHmYmj7xffQMqtzT]{Slow},</strong> <img src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Skill%20Icon/FFXIVIcons%20Battle(PvE)/BLU/peripheral_synthesis.png\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\"><strong>@UUID[JournalEntry.thBevyZDOURijH8I]{Petrify}</strong> and <img src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Buff%20Icon/Dark.png\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\"><strong>@UUID[JournalEntry.IBN7DtvWLFDo8jNh]{Stagger}</strong></p>",
          "icon": "",
          "macro_name": "",
          "roll": "",
          "special_name": "Solidifying Death"
        }
